<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Opportunities</span>
      <h1>SAC Award Programs</h1>
      <p>IEEE has created several Student Branch Awards to recognize and reward the efforts of tireless individuals and teams who make student branches thrive.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5); margin-bottom: var(--s-7); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ieee-blue) 6%, var(--surface))">
      <p style="margin: 0">All award nominations should be submitted via the <a href="https://ieee.secure-platform.com/a/solicitations/457/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Student Awards Portal</strong></a>. Submissions open <strong>1 February</strong> and close <strong>31 March</strong> each year.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/larry-k-wilson-regional-student-activities-award/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Larry K. Wilson Regional Student Activities Award</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">Recognizes, annually in each Region, the Student member most responsible for an extraordinary accomplishment associated with Student Activities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/ieee-regional-exemplary-student-branch-award/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IEEE Regional Exemplary Student Branch Award</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">Provides public recognition of exemplary IEEE Student Branch operations consistent with the goals of IEEE.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/ieee-regional-exemplary-student-branch-award/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Darrel Chong Student Activity Award</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">Serves to change the mindset of student groups from being number-driven to becoming value-driven and to acknowledge exemplary student activities worldwide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/ieee-outstanding-branch-counselor-and-branch-chapter-advisor-award/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IEEE Outstanding Branch Counselor and Branch Chapter Advisor Award</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">A cash award recognizing the unusual and dedicated efforts of approximately 20 outstanding Counselors and Advisors around the world.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/ieee-student-branch-website-contest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IEEE Student Branch Website Contest</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">An annual competition recognizing the best IEEE Student Branch websites for design, content, and usability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5)">
        <h3><a href="https://students.ieee.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Awards</a></h3>
        <p style="margin: 0">Visit the IEEE Students page to explore the full range of awards and recognition programs available.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
